  "prefLabel": "Sw 3001.07 Prize Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 3001.07 Prize Payments.\n\n(a) Claims for payment of a winning powerball ticket or subscription shall be made in accordance with the requirements set forth in Sw 600.\n\n(b) Claims submitted to the commission shall be subject to validation.\n\n(c) The first annuitized jackpot share shall be made not less than 15 calendar days following the claim.\n\nSource. #6356, eff 10-22-96; amd by #6609, eff 11-2-97; amd by #7095, eff 9-15-99; ss by #7169, eff 12-21-99; ss by #8162, eff 9-9-04; ss by #8367, eff 6-2-05; ss by #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #9519, eff 7-25-09, EXPIRED: 7-25-17",
